WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.360
Vocab Game Maker

00:00:02.340 --> 00:00:05.880
Builds a 10-minute, no-screen classroom game from 8 to 10 words,

00:00:06.160 --> 00:00:09.040
rules to read aloud, printable cards and a quick check.

00:00:10.220 --> 00:00:12.520
How to use it? Open it, read what it asks,

00:00:12.820 --> 00:00:15.760
then copy it into a chatbot or rent it in the demo store.

00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:18.260
Tap Go there to open it.
